 "remarks": "A rental rarely comes on in Regency Towers so here is your opportunity! Attractive updates can be found right here in this spacious 2BR/2BTH condo (1300+ square feet), A renovated kitchen boasts stainless steel appliances w/a newer Samsung French door refrigerator, and is enhanced by an eat-in breakfast nook peninsula. Newer classy luxury vinyl flooring highlights the large LR, DA, & both BR areas. 2 full BTHS offer each large BR separate private accommodations. There are abundant and organized closet and pantry spaces for your storage needs. The monthly HOA includes heat, hot water & cooking gas. The building offers several comforts including assigned indoor parking + extra outside visitor spaces, concierge + closed circuit security. A huge newly refurbished south facing balcony w/new railing and screens offers outdoor relaxation! Only 9 condos are located on this floor!  Enjoy having no residents live below this floor along with quick access to the lobby and the garage! The ideal location is just minutes to downtown Stamford and shopping along with being a 'stones throw' to the Tully Health & Medical Center. You will certainly find Regency Towers to be a well managed and extremely desirable condo association that residents, including the present owner, are proud of calling their home! #1A is move-in ready so don't pass this one up!",
